],
"lines": [
{
"n": 0,
"h": "4f7ee5b0",
"en_raw": "Oh, Kume..."
},
{
"n": 1,
"h": "688ba6e9",
"en_raw": "Three sighting spots"
},
{
"n": 2,
"h": "63356446",
"en_raw": "lined up in a straight line"
},
{
"n": 3,
"h": "b12d24c9",
"en_raw": "In feng shui terms, a dragon vein"
},
{
"n": 4,
"h": "e35eb41c",
"en_raw": "But here, let's boldly"
},
{
"n": 5,
"h": "ba5f53be",
"en_raw": "call it a ley line"
},
{
"n": 6,
"h": "d44f5b57",
"en_raw": "Murase, do you"
},
{
"n": 7,
"h": "408fa879",
"en_raw": "understand what that means?"
},
{
"n": 8,
"h": "34b0fc24",
"en_raw": "Sorry,"
},
{
"n": 9,
"h": "1c0f8a7b",
"en_raw": "I don't quite get it"
},
{
"n": 10,
"h": "98e15482",
"en_raw": "about what you said before..."
},
{
"n": 11,
"h": "7ce028b3",
"en_raw": "...Could that"
},
{
"n": 12,
"h": "a2c7f071",
"en_raw": "have something to do"
},
{
"n": 13,
"h": "89e36b32",
"en_raw": "with the wisp story?"
},
{
"n": 14,
"h": "f2f60d9c",
"en_raw": "As expected of Murase"
},
{
"n": 15,
"h": "4e995056",
"en_raw": "In occult knowledge"
},
{
"n": 16,
"h": "ec542654",
"en_raw": "you're now second only to me"
},
{
"n": 17,
"h": "ea49d7b0",
"en_raw": "Oh, thanks..."
},
{
"n": 18,
"h": "831b2b32",
"en_raw": "Yes, the wisps seen"
},
{
"n": 19,
"h": "cb6fc88e",
"en_raw": "so frequently lately..."
},
{
"n": 20,
"h": "beeba988",
"en_raw": "I'm convinced there's a certain"
},
{
"n": 21,
"h": "4964bada",
"en_raw": "regularity to them"
},
{
"n": 22,
"h": "f82e85af",
"en_raw": "Mark the sighting spots"
},
{
"n": 23,
"h": "f894896d",
"en_raw": "on a map and see"
},
{
"n": 24,
"h": "b37178b3",
"en_raw": "The reservoir, Takadai, the Wildflower Garden"
},
{
"n": 25,
"h": "cf333975",
"en_raw": "They should line up in a perfect straight line"
},
{
"n": 26,
"h": "55f7397c",
"en_raw": "This is a ley line showing"
},
{
"n": 27,
"h": "bce8e3a8",
"en_raw": "the power of the earth once lost"
},
{
"n": 28,
"h": "906e5645",
"en_raw": "showing signs of revival, I'd say"
},
{
"n": 29,
"h": "90f62ba0",
"en_raw": "no doubt about it..."
},
{
"n": 30,
"h": "d4686e08",
"en_raw": "So?"
},
{
"n": 31,
"h": "bed3b4ec",
"en_raw": "And so?"
},
{
"n": 32,
"h": "df2ef4e3",
"en_raw": "Aren't you surprised?"
},
{
"n": 33,
"h": "a96f16c4",
"en_raw": "Oh, no, I'm surprised..."
},
{
"n": 34,
"h": "1bea3f0d",
"en_raw": "Well, never mind, anyway today"
},
{
"n": 35,
"h": "8506022c",
"en_raw": "let's go to the sites in question"
},
{
"n": 36,
"h": "904af72a",
"en_raw": "With you, Murase, who has a strong power"
},
{
"n": 37,
"h": "f8b30d5b",
"en_raw": "to summon the supernatural"
},
{
"n": 38,
"h": "e4237230",
"en_raw": "we might meet something"
},
{
"n": 39,
"h": "68d4d6fb",
"en_raw": "beyond a wisp"
},
{
"n": 40,
"h": "3d7905ff",
"en_raw": "Obtained the rumor of the Will-o'-the-Wisp!"
},
{
"n": 41,
"h": "da5a63a8",
"en_raw": "But today's a bit..."
},
{
"n": 42,
"h": "59532891",
"en_raw": "What it indicates is Mt. Fuji erupting"
},
{
"n": 43,
"h": "d5cdd884",
"en_raw": "or Atlantis rising"
},
{
"n": 44,
"h": "de7dc206",
"en_raw": "or something even bigger..."
},
{
"n": 45,
"h": "96eada3c",
"en_raw": "For example, the descent"
},
{
"n": 46,
"h": "c9e768be",
"en_raw": "of a cosmic will..."
},
{
"n": 47,
"h": "4028e26e",
"en_raw": "When I think of what lies beyond that"
},
{
"n": 48,
"h": "81cb25fa",
"en_raw": "I can't stop trembling"
},
{
"n": 49,
"h": "2676d431",
"en_raw": "You should answer questions clearly"
},
{
"n": 50,
"h": "f6ed1039",
"en_raw": "You're not a dummy doll"
},
{
"n": 51,
"h": "8bd2a868",
"en_raw": "Oh, I have to..."
}
]
}